<p>Compiling that:</p>
<ul>
<li>each page carries its own widget in its own <code>/Annots</code> array — <code>/Annots[5 0 R]</code> on the first,
<code>/Annots[7 0 R]</code> on the second — each widget's <code>/P</code> pointing back at its page</li>
<li>the catalog collects both into <code>&lt;&lt;/Fields[5 0 R 7 0 R]&gt;&gt;</code></li>
<li>the indices aren't consecutive, because the second page object was written between the two widgets</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="adding-a-field-to-a-page">Adding a Field to a Page<a class="anchor" href="#adding-a-field-to-a-page" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>

<p><code>addField($field, $form, $x, $y)</code> takes the field, the name of the form it belongs to, and the
coordinates of the widget rectangle's bottom left corner. Both coordinates default to <code>0</code>, and the
method returns the page, so fields chain:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Form</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Font</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Field\Button</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Field\Choice</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Field\Text</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Pdf</span>;

<span class="text-var">$name</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Text</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;full_name&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">font</span>: <span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">HELVETICA</span>, <span class="text-type">size</span>: <span class="text-num">12</span>);
<span class="text-var">$name</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setWidth</span>(<span class="text-num">240</span>);
<span class="text-var">$name</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setHeight</span>(<span class="text-num">24</span>);

<span class="text-var">$notes</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Text</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;notes&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">font</span>: <span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">HELVETICA</span>, <span class="text-type">size</span>: <span class="text-num">12</span>);
<span class="text-var">$notes</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setWidth</span>(<span class="text-num">240</span>);
<span class="text-var">$notes</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setHeight</span>(<span class="text-num">72</span>);
<span class="text-var">$notes</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setMultiline</span>();

<span class="text-var">$country</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Choice</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;country&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">font</span>: <span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">HELVETICA</span>, <span class="text-type">size</span>: <span class="text-num">12</span>);
<span class="text-var">$country</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setWidth</span>(<span class="text-num">240</span>);
<span class="text-var">$country</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setHeight</span>(<span class="text-num">24</span>);
<span class="text-var">$country</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addOption</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Canada&#039;</span>)-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addOption</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Mexico&#039;</span>)-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addOption</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;United States&#039;</span>);
<span class="text-var">$country</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setCombo</span>();

<span class="text-var">$agree</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Button</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;agree&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">font</span>: <span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">HELVETICA</span>, <span class="text-type">size</span>: <span class="text-num">12</span>);
<span class="text-var">$agree</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setWidth</span>(<span class="text-num">16</span>);
<span class="text-var">$agree</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setHeight</span>(<span class="text-num">16</span>);
<span class="text-var">$agree</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addOption</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Yes&#039;</span>);

<span class="text-var">$page</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Page</span>(<span class="text-type">Page</span>::<span class="text-num">LETTER</span>);
<span class="text-var">$page</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addField</span>(<span class="text-var">$name</span>, <span class="text-str">&#039;signup&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">x</span>: <span class="text-num">72</span>, <span class="text-type">y</span>: <span class="text-num">680</span>)
     -&gt;<span class="text-fn">addField</span>(<span class="text-var">$notes</span>, <span class="text-str">&#039;signup&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">x</span>: <span class="text-num">72</span>, <span class="text-type">y</span>: <span class="text-num">560</span>)
     -&gt;<span class="text-fn">addField</span>(<span class="text-var">$country</span>, <span class="text-str">&#039;signup&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">x</span>: <span class="text-num">72</span>, <span class="text-type">y</span>: <span class="text-num">500</span>)
     -&gt;<span class="text-fn">addField</span>(<span class="text-var">$agree</span>, <span class="text-str">&#039;signup&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">x</span>: <span class="text-num">72</span>, <span class="text-type">y</span>: <span class="text-num">460</span>);

<span class="text-var">$form</span>     = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Form</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;signup&#039;</span>);
<span class="text-var">$document</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Document</span>(<span class="text-var">$page</span>);
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addFont</span>(<span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">HELVETICA</span>);
