<p>That writes a 1,777-byte single-page letter document at PDF version 1.7, whose catalog carries
<code>&lt;&lt;/Fields[6 0 R 7 0 R 8 0 R 9 0 R]&gt;&gt;</code> and whose page carries the matching
<code>/Annots[6 0 R 7 0 R 8 0 R 9 0 R]</code>. The four widgets compile to:</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Object</th>
<th><code>/FT</code></th>
<th><code>/T</code></th>
<th><code>/Rect</code></th>
<th><code>/Ff</code></th>
<th><code>/Opt</code></th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>6</code></td>
<td><code>/Tx</code></td>
<td><code>full_name</code></td>
<td><code>[72 680 312 704]</code></td>
<td>—</td>
<td>—</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>7</code></td>
<td><code>/Tx</code></td>
<td><code>notes</code></td>
<td><code>[72 560 312 632]</code></td>
<td><code>4096</code></td>
<td>—</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>8</code></td>
<td><code>/Ch</code></td>
<td><code>country</code></td>
<td><code>[72 500 312 524]</code></td>
<td><code>131072</code></td>
<td><code>[ (Canada) (Mexico) (United States) ]</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>9</code></td>
<td><code>/Btn</code></td>
<td><code>agree</code></td>
<td><code>[72 460 88 476]</code></td>
<td>—</td>
<td><code>[ (Yes) ]</code></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>The second argument must match a registered form name exactly. A field naming a form that was never
registered is dropped silently at compile time — no widget object, no <code>/Annots</code> entry — and a form
that is registered but never named by a field compiles with an empty <code>&lt;&lt;/Fields[]&gt;&gt;</code>.</p>
<p>Written out in full, the first field is:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">TEXT</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code>/Type /Annot
/Subtype /Widget
/FT /Tx
/Rect [72 680 312 704]
/P 5 0 R
/DA(/MF1 12 Tf 0 g)
/T(full_name)/TU(full_name)/TM(full_name)
</code></pre>
</div>

<p>That shape holds for every field:</p>
<ul>
<li>the <code>/Rect</code> runs from the <code>addField()</code> coordinates to those coordinates plus the field's width and
height — the 240 by 24 field at 72, 680 covers x 72–312, y 680–704; the 16 by 16 checkbox at 72, 460
covers <code>[72 460 88 476]</code></li>
<li>a field with no <code>setWidth()</code>/<code>setHeight()</code> call compiles with a degenerate <code>/Rect [72 680 72 680]</code> —
four corners on one point, no error</li>
<li>the name reaches the dictionary three times: the partial name <code>/T</code>, the tooltip <code>/TU</code> and the
mapping name <code>/TM</code></li>
<li><code>/P</code> points back at the page object the widget sits on</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="options-every-field-has">Options Every Field Has<a class="anchor" href="#options-every-field-has" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>

<p>Every field type extends <code>Field\AbstractField</code> and takes the same constructor —
<code>__construct($name, $font = null, $size = 12)</code> — and the same setters. All of them return the field,
so a whole configuration is one chain:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Font</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Field\Text</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Color\Color\Rgb</span>;

<span class="text-var">$field</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Text</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;full_name&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">font</span>: <span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">HELVETICA</span>, <span class="text-type">size</span>: <span class="text-num">14</span>);
<span class="text-var">$field</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setWidth</span>(<span class="text-num">240</span>)
      -&gt;<span class="text-fn">setHeight</span>(<span class="text-num">24</span>)
      -&gt;<span class="text-fn">setValue</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Alex Doe&#039;</span>)
      -&gt;<span class="text-fn">setDefaultValue</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Alex Doe&#039;</span>)
      -&gt;<span class="text-fn">setFontColor</span>(<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Rgb</span>(<span class="text-num">0</span>, <span class="text-num">51</span>, <span class="text-num">102</span>))
      -&gt;<span class="text-fn">setRequired</span>();
</code></pre>
</div>

<p><code>setValue()</code> and <code>setDefaultValue()</code> write <code>/V</code> and <code>/DV</code> into the dictionary:</p>
<ul>
<li>on a text field, hand each one the plain string — <code>Field\Text</code> quotes and escapes it for you, so
the chain above emits <code>/V (Alex Doe)</code> and <code>/DV (Alex Doe)</code></li>
<li>a leading <code>/</code> still marks a name value rather than a string, the form a checkbox, radio button or
push button field's on and off states take; see Buttons below</li>
<li><code>getValue()</code> and <code>getDefaultValue()</code> read them back, and both start out <code>null</code></li>
</ul>
<p><code>setFont()</code> names a font, <code>setSize()</code> sets the point size and <code>setFontColor()</code> takes any <code>Pop\Color</code>
implementation. The three travel together into the field's default appearance string, <code>/DA</code>, and that
string is written once the named font is registered on the document with <code>addFont()</code>:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Form</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Font</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Field\Text</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Pdf</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Color\Color\Rgb</span>;

<span class="text-var">$field</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Text</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;full_name&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">font</span>: <span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">HELVETICA</span>);
<span class="text-var">$field</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setWidth</span>(<span class="text-num">240</span>);
<span class="text-var">$field</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setHeight</span>(<span class="text-num">24</span>);
<span class="text-var">$field</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setSize</span>(<span class="text-num">30</span>);
<span class="text-var">$field</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setFontColor</span>(<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Rgb</span>(<span class="text-num">255</span>, <span class="text-num">0</span>, <span class="text-num">0</span>));

<span class="text-var">$page</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Page</span>(<span class="text-type">Page</span>::<span class="text-num">LETTER</span>);
<span class="text-var">$page</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addField</span>(<span class="text-var">$field</span>, <span class="text-str">&#039;signup&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">x</span>: <span class="text-num">72</span>, <span class="text-type">y</span>: <span class="text-num">680</span>);

<span class="text-var">$document</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Document</span>(<span class="text-var">$page</span>);
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addFont</span>(<span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">HELVETICA</span>);
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addForm</span>(<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Form</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;signup&#039;</span>));

<span class="text-type">Pdf</span>::<span class="text-fn">writeToFile</span>(<span class="text-var">$document</span>, <span class="text-type">filename</span>: <span class="text-kw">__DIR__</span> . <span class="text-str">&#039;/signup.pdf&#039;</span>);
</code></pre>
</div>

<p>That field compiles with <code>/DA(/MF1 30 Tf 1 0 0 rg)</code> — the document's reference for Helvetica, the
size, and the color, each color space rendering in its own operator:</p>
<ul>
<li>in the same field, <code>new Color\Cmyk(100, 0, 0, 0)</code> renders <code>1 0 0 0 k</code> and <code>new Color\Grayscale(50)</code>
renders <code>0.5 g</code></li>
<li>registering a second font shifts the reference — a field naming Helvetica on a document that
registered Arial first compiles with <code>/MF2</code></li>
<li>every font a field names must be registered — compiling a field whose font is absent raises
<code>Pop\Pdf\Build\Exception</code> naming it</li>
<li>a field with no <code>setFont()</code> call compiles with no <code>/DA</code> entry at all, taking the reader's own
default appearance</li>
<li>the default color, where a font is set but a color is not, is <code>0 g</code>, black</li>
</ul>
<p><code>getFont()</code>, <code>getSize()</code>, <code>getFontColor()</code>, <code>getWidth()</code> and <code>getHeight()</code> read the current values.
Size starts at <code>12</code>; font, color, width and height start at <code>null</code>.</p>
<p>Three flags are shared by every field type, and each writes one bit into <code>/Ff</code>:</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Setter</th>
<th><code>/Ff</code> value</th>
<th>Flag bit</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>setReadOnly()</code></td>
<td><code>1</code></td>
<td>1</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>setRequired()</code></td>
<td><code>2</code></td>
<td>2</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>setNoExport()</code></td>
<td><code>4</code></td>
<td>3</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>Flags accumulate into a single integer, so <code>setReadOnly()-&gt;setRequired()-&gt;setNoExport()</code> emits
<code>/Ff 7</code>. Calling one of them more than once sets the bit once — three <code>setMultiline()</code> calls emit
<code>/Ff 4096</code>, the same as one. A field with no flag setter called on it emits no <code>/Ff</code> entry at all.</p>
<h2 id="text-fields">Text Fields<a class="anchor" href="#text-fields" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>

<p><code>Field\Text</code> compiles to <code>/FT /Tx</code>. Give one a width and a height and call nothing else, and it
compiles with a <code>/Rect</code> and no <code>/Ff</code> at all — the plain single-line entry box. Each setter below turns
that box into a variant by adding one flag bit, and each returns the field.</p>
<h3 id="multiline">Multiline<a class="anchor" href="#multiline" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h3>

<p><code>setMultiline()</code> emits <code>/Ff 4096</code>, flag bit 13, which is the bit a reader checks to wrap typing onto
a second line instead of scrolling it sideways. Pair it with a height that has room for the lines:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Font</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Field\Text</span>;

<span class="text-var">$notes</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Text</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;notes&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">font</span>: <span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">HELVETICA</span>, <span class="text-type">size</span>: <span class="text-num">12</span>);
<span class="text-var">$notes</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setWidth</span>(<span class="text-num">240</span>);
<span class="text-var">$notes</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setHeight</span>(<span class="text-num">72</span>);
<span class="text-var">$notes</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setMultiline</span>();
</code></pre>
</div>

<p><code>isMultiline()</code> reports whether the bit is set, and returns <code>false</code> on a field straight from the
constructor.</p>
<h3 id="password">Password<a class="anchor" href="#password" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h3>

<p><code>setPassword()</code> emits <code>/Ff 8192</code>, flag bit 14, the bit that has the reader echo each typed character
as a bullet:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Font</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Field\Text</span>;

<span class="text-var">$secret</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Text</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;passphrase&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">font</span>: <span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">HELVETICA</span>, <span class="text-type">size</span>: <span class="text-num">12</span>);
<span class="text-var">$secret</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setWidth</span>(<span class="text-num">240</span>);
<span class="text-var">$secret</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setHeight</span>(<span class="text-num">24</span>);
<span class="text-var">$secret</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setPassword</span>();
</code></pre>
</div>

<p><code>isPassword()</code> reads the bit back.</p>
<h3 id="comb-fields">Comb Fields<a class="anchor" href="#comb-fields" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h3>

<p><code>setComb()</code> emits <code>/Ff 16777216</code>, flag bit 25 — the bit that lays the field out as evenly spaced cells,
one character per cell, which is the shape a serial number or a postal code wants:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Font</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Field\Text</span>;

<span class="text-var">$zip</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Text</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;postal_code&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">font</span>: <span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">HELVETICA</span>, <span class="text-type">size</span>: <span class="text-num">12</span>);
<span class="text-var">$zip</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setWidth</span>(<span class="text-num">120</span>);
<span class="text-var">$zip</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setHeight</span>(<span class="text-num">24</span>);
<span class="text-var">$zip</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setComb</span>();
</code></pre>
</div>

<h3 id="file-select">File Select<a class="anchor" href="#file-select" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h3>

<p><code>setFileSelect()</code> emits <code>/Ff 1048576</code>, flag bit 21, which marks the field's contents as the path of a
file to submit rather than text to submit literally:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Font</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Field\Text</span>;

<span class="text-var">$upload</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Text</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;attachment&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">font</span>: <span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">HELVETICA</span>, <span class="text-type">size</span>: <span class="text-num">12</span>);
<span class="text-var">$upload</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setWidth</span>(<span class="text-num">240</span>);
<span class="text-var">$upload</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setHeight</span>(<span class="text-num">24</span>);
<span class="text-var">$upload</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setFileSelect</span>();
</code></pre>
</div>

<h3 id="rich-text">Rich Text<a class="anchor" href="#rich-text" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h3>

<p><code>setRichText()</code> emits <code>/Ff 33554432</code>, flag bit 26, which lets the field carry styled text instead of
one uniform run:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Font</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Field\Text</span>;

<span class="text-var">$bio</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Text</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;biography&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">font</span>: <span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">HELVETICA</span>, <span class="text-type">size</span>: <span class="text-num">12</span>);
<span class="text-var">$bio</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setWidth</span>(<span class="text-num">240</span>);
<span class="text-var">$bio</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setHeight</span>(<span class="text-num">96</span>);
<span class="text-var">$bio</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setMultiline</span>();
<span class="text-var">$bio</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setRichText</span>();
</code></pre>
</div>

<p>Flags combine freely, and that pair emits <code>/Ff 33558528</code>.</p>
<h3 id="spell-check-and-scrolling">Spell Check and Scrolling<a class="anchor" href="#spell-check-and-scrolling" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h3>

<p><code>setDoNotSpellCheck()</code> emits <code>/Ff 4194304</code>, flag bit 23, and <code>setDoNotScroll()</code> emits <code>/Ff 8388608</code>,
flag bit 24. The first has the reader accept the entry as typed rather than underlining it, which
suits a part number or a reference code; the second caps entry at what the rectangle can display:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Font</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Field\Text</span>;

<span class="text-var">$sku</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Text</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;sku&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">font</span>: <span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">HELVETICA</span>, <span class="text-type">size</span>: <span class="text-num">12</span>);
<span class="text-var">$sku</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setWidth</span>(<span class="text-num">160</span>);
<span class="text-var">$sku</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setHeight</span>(<span class="text-num">24</span>);
<span class="text-var">$sku</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setDoNotSpellCheck</span>();
<span class="text-var">$sku</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setDoNotScroll</span>();
<span class="text-var">$sku</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setComb</span>();
</code></pre>
</div>

<p>The three together emit <code>/Ff 29360128</code>.</p>
<h2 id="choice-fields">Choice Fields<a class="anchor" href="#choice-fields" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>

<p><code>Field\Choice</code> compiles to <code>/FT /Ch</code> and covers both dropdowns and list boxes. <code>addOption()</code> takes one
string and appends it to the field's option list, which compiles to <code>/Opt</code>:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Font</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Field\Choice</span>;

<span class="text-var">$country</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Choice</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;country&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">font</span>: <span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">HELVETICA</span>, <span class="text-type">size</span>: <span class="text-num">12</span>);
<span class="text-var">$country</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setWidth</span>(<span class="text-num">240</span>);
<span class="text-var">$country</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setHeight</span>(<span class="text-num">24</span>);
<span class="text-var">$country</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addOption</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Canada&#039;</span>);
<span class="text-var">$country</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addOption</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Mexico&#039;</span>);
<span class="text-var">$country</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addOption</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;United States&#039;</span>);
</code></pre>
</div>

<p>That code:</p>
<ul>
<li>emits <code>/Opt [ (Canada) (Mexico) (United States) ]</code>, in the order the options were added</li>
<li><code>hasOptions()</code> reports whether any have been added, and returns <code>false</code> on a new field</li>
<li>a <code>Field\Choice</code> with a width and a height and nothing else compiles to <code>/FT /Ch</code> with a <code>/Rect</code>,
no <code>/Opt</code> and no <code>/Ff</code> — add options to give the field its list</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="dropdowns">Dropdowns<a class="anchor" href="#dropdowns" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h3>

<p><code>setCombo()</code> emits <code>/Ff 131072</code>, flag bit 18, which turns the list into a dropdown that shows one row
until it is opened. <code>setEdit()</code> emits <code>/Ff 262144</code>, flag bit 19, which lets the reader type a value
the list does not offer:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Font</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Field\Choice</span>;

<span class="text-var">$country</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Choice</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;country&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">font</span>: <span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">HELVETICA</span>, <span class="text-type">size</span>: <span class="text-num">12</span>);
<span class="text-var">$country</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setWidth</span>(<span class="text-num">240</span>);
<span class="text-var">$country</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setHeight</span>(<span class="text-num">24</span>);
<span class="text-var">$country</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addOption</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Canada&#039;</span>)-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addOption</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Mexico&#039;</span>)-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addOption</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;United States&#039;</span>);
<span class="text-var">$country</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setCombo</span>();
<span class="text-var">$country</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setEdit</span>();
</code></pre>
</div>

<p>The pair emits <code>/Ff 393216</code>. <code>isCombo()</code> reads bit 18 back.</p>
<h3 id="list-boxes">List Boxes<a class="anchor" href="#list-boxes" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h3>

<p>Leave <code>setCombo()</code> off and the field is a list box showing as many rows as its height allows.
<code>setMultiSelect()</code> emits <code>/Ff 2097152</code>, flag bit 22, which lets more than one row be chosen at once,
and <code>setSort()</code> emits <code>/Ff 524288</code>, flag bit 20, which has the reader present the options in
alphabetical order:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Font</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Field\Choice</span>;

<span class="text-var">$topics</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Choice</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;topics&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">font</span>: <span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">HELVETICA</span>, <span class="text-type">size</span>: <span class="text-num">12</span>);
<span class="text-var">$topics</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setWidth</span>(<span class="text-num">240</span>);
<span class="text-var">$topics</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setHeight</span>(<span class="text-num">96</span>);
<span class="text-var">$topics</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addOption</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Releases&#039;</span>)-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addOption</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Events&#039;</span>)-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addOption</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Announcements&#039;</span>);
<span class="text-var">$topics</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setMultiSelect</span>();
<span class="text-var">$topics</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setSort</span>();
</code></pre>
</div>

<p><code>/Opt</code> keeps the insertion order you gave it and the sort flag is what asks the reader to reorder the
display, so <code>addOption('Zebra')-&gt;addOption('Aardvark')-&gt;setSort()</code> compiles to
<code>/Opt [ (Zebra) (Aardvark) ]</code> with <code>/Ff 524288</code>. <code>isMultiSelect()</code> reads bit 22 back.</p>
<h3 id="commit-on-change">Commit on Change<a class="anchor" href="#commit-on-change" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h3>

<p><code>setCommitOnSelChange()</code> emits <code>/Ff 67108864</code>, flag bit 27, which commits the new selection the moment
it is picked rather than when focus moves off the field. <code>setDoNotSpellCheck()</code> is available here too
and emits the same <code>/Ff 4194304</code> it does on a text field:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Font</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Field\Choice</span>;

<span class="text-var">$plan</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Choice</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;plan&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">font</span>: <span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">HELVETICA</span>, <span class="text-type">size</span>: <span class="text-num">12</span>);
<span class="text-var">$plan</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setWidth</span>(<span class="text-num">240</span>);
<span class="text-var">$plan</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setHeight</span>(<span class="text-num">96</span>);
<span class="text-var">$plan</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addOption</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Monthly&#039;</span>)-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addOption</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Annual&#039;</span>);
<span class="text-var">$plan</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setMultiSelect</span>();
<span class="text-var">$plan</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setCommitOnSelChange</span>();
</code></pre>
</div>

<p>Those two emit <code>/Ff 69206016</code>.</p>
<h2 id="buttons">Buttons<a class="anchor" href="#buttons" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>

<p><code>Field\Button</code> compiles to <code>/FT /Btn</code> and covers checkboxes, radio groups and push buttons:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>addOption($option, $xOffset = 0, $yOffset = 0)</code> takes the option label and two offsets that
default to <code>0</code></li>
<li>the label is what reaches <code>/Opt</code></li>
<li>the two offsets are recorded on the option only — neither reaches the compiled document nor comes
back from a getter</li>
</ul>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Font</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Field\Button</span>;

<span class="text-var">$agree</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Button</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;agree&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">font</span>: <span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">HELVETICA</span>, <span class="text-type">size</span>: <span class="text-num">12</span>);
<span class="text-var">$agree</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setWidth</span>(<span class="text-num">16</span>);
<span class="text-var">$agree</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setHeight</span>(<span class="text-num">16</span>);
<span class="text-var">$agree</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addOption</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Yes&#039;</span>);
</code></pre>
</div>

<p>With no flag setter called, that is a checkbox: <code>/FT /Btn</code>, a 16 by 16 rectangle, <code>/Opt [ (Yes) ]</code>
and no <code>/Ff</code>. <code>hasOptions()</code> reports whether any options have been added.</p>
<p>A button's on and off states are names rather than strings, so give <code>setValue()</code> and
<code>setDefaultValue()</code> a leading slash to have the box start out checked and reset to clear:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Font</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Field\Button</span>;

<span class="text-var">$agree</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Button</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;agree&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">font</span>: <span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">HELVETICA</span>, <span class="text-type">size</span>: <span class="text-num">12</span>);
<span class="text-var">$agree</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setWidth</span>(<span class="text-num">16</span>);
<span class="text-var">$agree</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setHeight</span>(<span class="text-num">16</span>);
<span class="text-var">$agree</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addOption</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Yes&#039;</span>);
<span class="text-var">$agree</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setValue</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;/Yes&#039;</span>);
<span class="text-var">$agree</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setDefaultValue</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;/Off&#039;</span>);
</code></pre>
</div>

<p>That emits <code>/V /Yes</code> and <code>/DV /Off</code>. A <code>Field\Choice</code> takes the same two setters, but writes the
value to the dictionary exactly as given rather than quoting it — <code>setValue('(Canada)')</code> emits
<code>/V (Canada)</code>, preselecting that row of the list.</p>
<h3 id="radio-groups">Radio Groups<a class="anchor" href="#radio-groups" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h3>

<p>Three flags apply to a <code>Field\Button</code> used as a radio option:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>setRadio()</code> emits <code>/Ff 32768</code>, flag bit 16 — treats the field as one choice among several</li>
<li><code>setNoToggleToOff()</code> emits <code>/Ff 16384</code>, flag bit 15 — keeps a chosen option chosen when clicked a
second time</li>
<li><code>setRadiosInUnison()</code> emits <code>/Ff 33554432</code>, flag bit 26 — turns every box sharing an export value on
together</li>
</ul>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Font</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Field\Button</span>;

<span class="text-var">$email</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Button</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;contact_method&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">font</span>: <span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">HELVETICA</span>, <span class="text-type">size</span>: <span class="text-num">12</span>);
<span class="text-var">$email</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setWidth</span>(<span class="text-num">16</span>);
<span class="text-var">$email</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setHeight</span>(<span class="text-num">16</span>);
<span class="text-var">$email</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addOption</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Email&#039;</span>);
<span class="text-var">$email</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setRadio</span>();
<span class="text-var">$email</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setNoToggleToOff</span>();

<span class="text-var">$phone</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Button</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;contact_method&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">font</span>: <span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">HELVETICA</span>, <span class="text-type">size</span>: <span class="text-num">12</span>);
<span class="text-var">$phone</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setWidth</span>(<span class="text-num">16</span>);
<span class="text-var">$phone</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setHeight</span>(<span class="text-num">16</span>);
<span class="text-var">$phone</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addOption</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Phone&#039;</span>);
<span class="text-var">$phone</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setRadio</span>();
<span class="text-var">$phone</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setNoToggleToOff</span>();
</code></pre>
</div>

<p>Building a radio group:</p>
<ul>
<li>each pair above emits <code>/Ff 49152</code></li>
<li>one <code>Field\Button</code> compiles to one rectangle, sized by <code>setWidth()</code>/<code>setHeight()</code> and placed by
<code>addField()</code> — build the group from one <code>Field\Button</code> per box, sharing a field name and each with
its own coordinates; added at 72, 700 and 72, 670, the two above compile to <code>/Rect [72 700 88 716]</code>
and <code>/Rect [72 670 88 686]</code>, both indexed into the form</li>
<li>give each box its own <code>addOption()</code> label and let the shared <code>/T</code> name tie them together, then call
<code>setValue()</code> with the option that starts out chosen: <code>$email-&gt;setValue('/Email')</code> emits <code>/V /Email</code>
alongside that box's <code>/Ff 32768</code></li>
<li><code>isRadio()</code> reads bit 16 back</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="push-buttons">Push Buttons<a class="anchor" href="#push-buttons" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h3>

<p><code>setPushButton()</code> emits <code>/Ff 65536</code>, flag bit 17, which makes the field an action button that holds no
value of its own:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Font</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Field\Button</span>;

<span class="text-var">$submit</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Button</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;submit&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">font</span>: <span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">HELVETICA</span>, <span class="text-type">size</span>: <span class="text-num">12</span>);
<span class="text-var">$submit</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setWidth</span>(<span class="text-num">80</span>);
<span class="text-var">$submit</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setHeight</span>(<span class="text-num">24</span>);
<span class="text-var">$submit</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addOption</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Submit&#039;</span>);
<span class="text-var">$submit</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setPushButton</span>();
</code></pre>
</div>

<p><code>isPushButton()</code> reads bit 17 back. Give a push button a <code>setFont()</code> and register that font on the
document to get a <code>/DA</code> string the reader draws its caption with.</p>
